---
import type { Lang } from "../../lib/i18n";
import { local } from "./shared";
import { moneyText } from "./monetization";
import "./monetization-controls.css";
interface Props {
  lang: Lang;
}
const { lang } = Astro.props;
const t = local(lang),
  m = moneyText(lang, "freemium");
---

<section
  data-demo="freemium"
  data-money
  lang={lang}
  data-reset-message={m.resetMessage}
>
  <header>
    <p class="eyebrow">{m.fiction}</p>
    <h2>{t("Freemium", "프리미엄 무료 모델", "フリーミアム")}</h2>
  </header>
  <p>
    {t(
      "Personal notebook · editing and PDF export · three-day clock",
      "개인 노트 앱 · 편집과 PDF 내보내기 · 3일 시계",
      "個人ノートアプリ · 編集とPDF出力 · 3日間の時計",
    )}
  </p>
  <p data-plan>{m.free}</p>
  <div class="features">
    <div>
      <h3>{t("Editing", "편집", "編集")}</h3>
      <strong data-edit-access>{m.available}</strong>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3>PDF</h3>
      <strong data-export-access>{m.locked}</strong>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="clock">
    <span>
      {m.day}: <b data-day>0</b> / 3
    </span>
    <button type="button" data-day-next data-interactive disabled>
      {t("Advance one day", "하루 진행", "1日進める")}
    </button>
  </div>
  <div class="controls">
    <button type="button" data-edit data-interactive disabled>
      {t("Edit a note", "노트 편집", "ノートを編集")}
    </button>
    <button type="button" data-export data-interactive disabled>
      {t("Export PDF", "PDF 내보내기", "PDF出力")}
    </button>
  </div>
  <p>
    {t("Completed actions", "완료 동작", "完了した操作")}: <b data-actions>0</b>
  </p>
  <div class="controls">
    <button type="button" data-upgrade data-interactive disabled>
      {t(
        "Choose paid access (simulated)",
        "유료 이용 선택 (가상)",
        "有料利用を選ぶ（仮）",
      )}
    </button>
  </div>
  <p>
    {t(
      "Free editing never expires here. Paid access unlocks PDF export. No payment is processed.",
      "여기서 무료 편집은 만료되지 않습니다. 유료 이용은 PDF 내보내기를 엽니다. 실제 결제는 없습니다.",
      "この例では無料編集に期限はありません。有料利用でPDF出力を開放します。実際の決済はありません。",
    )}
  </p>
  <p class="assumptions">
    {t(
      "Prices, taxes, fees and refunds omitted.",
      "가격·세금·수수료·환불은 생략했습니다.",
      "価格・税金・手数料・返金は省略しています。",
    )}
  </p>
  <div class="controls">
    <button type="button" data-reset data-interactive disabled>
      {m.reset}
    </button>
  </div>
  <p data-contract-context class="contract-context">
    {t(
      "The user edits for free after day three, while PDF export requires paid access. The paid button changes entitlement locally; price, billing interval and seller terms are unspecified. No payment is processed.",
      "사용자는 3일이 지나도 무료 편집하며 PDF 출력에는 유료 권한이 필요합니다. 유료 버튼은 로컬 권한만 바꾸고 가격·청구 주기·판매 조건은 미정입니다. 결제를 처리하지 않습니다.",
      "利用者は3日後も無料で編集し、PDF出力には有料権限が必要です。有料ボタンはローカル権限だけを変え、価格・請求周期・販売条件は未定です。決済は行いません。",
    )}
  </p>
  <p role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"></p>
</section>
<script>
  import { mountAccess } from "./monetization-access";
  mountAccess("freemium", false);
</script>
<style>
  .features {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  .features > div {
    background: #fff;
    padding: 1rem;
    border: 2px solid #52766e;
  }
  .clock {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: center;
    margin: 1rem 0;
  }
  .trial {
    border-left: 5px solid #956122;
    background: #faecd5;
    padding: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  @container (max-width:350px) {
    .features {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  .features {
    border: 4px solid #4c6848;
    padding: 24px;
  }
  [data-edit-access],
  [data-export-access] {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 800;
  }
  .clock {
    border-bottom: 5px solid #4c6848;
    padding: 24px;
  }
</style>
